// Committed, shared base for local/device builds. Referenced by project.yml's `configFiles`, so
// xcodegen bakes this in on every `xcodegen generate` instead of the Xcode-set Team getting wiped
// out each time the project is regenerated.
//
// Team-specific values go in Local.Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored — see
// Local.Secrets.xcconfig.example) which this optionally includes. `#include?` (note the `?`) is a
// no-op if that file doesn't exist, so this stays safe for CI and a fresh clone with no team
// configured yet — simulator builds work fine without one.
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
#include? "Local.Secrets.xcconfig"
